data floor_resolve_realization_note: String = "Thin re-export of gunbc.ci_materialization resolve-obligation authority (0B, 2026-08-04). Expected population and finalization law live in ci_materialization; shared-pool provider id is consumed from gunbc.floor_materialization via ci_materialization import. claim_executor observes; ci_floor_plan transports declared_resolve_count only."

fn ci_floor_resolve_obligation_roster() -> List<ResolveObligationIdentity> {
  ci_floor_resolve_obligation_identities()
}

fn ci_floor_resolve_obligation_count() -> Nat {
  ci_floor_expected_resolve_obligation_count()
}

data roadmap_render_witness_cost_receipt_note: String = "Roadmap-render witness cost census (shared CI floor item 0, operator-measured 2026-08-04, three populations — NOT one cluster). CLASS A (this lane): witness_per_artifact_red_receipts rehomed to dag/test/claim/long/generated_artifact_drift_red_receipt_witness_test.dag — nine heterogeneous committed generators (CiYaml through Plan), each with its own artifact_generate and perturb-sensitive drift pair; no single shared producer to hoist (operator remedy 1); narrowing drops real per-generator coverage (remedy 2). Direct precedent: generated_artifact_drift_test.dag fixed_point_witness_long_lane_note (operator 2026-08-03, same 5-second rule, same inline gate coverage). Measured 4350-4776ms on green main; drift gate still runs artifact_red_receipt_ok inline. CLASS B (PR #7791, NOT this lane): six roadmap healthz witnesses ~5000ms when roadmap inputs change — render whole site behind warm memo. CLASS C: witness_bounded_poll_early_exit_on_grounded_read ~3260ms, witness_digest_readback_script_is_bounded_and_post_mutation ~2719ms."
